  "title": "Why CI/CD won’t save your mobile team",
  "summary": "Surprising as it may seem, and while the scale and stakes might differ, it turns out a lot can be learned from aerospace about the role of automation and its impact on the humans involved: from its initial rise and specific applications, to the friction and risks its ever-growing importance created, to the kinds of solutions and measures put in place to ensure its safe and effective use.",
